<div class="page-head">
  <div>
    <h1>Research</h1>
    <div class="sub">Deep-dive scenario analysis on your finances — results in 30–50 minutes.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="widget-grid">
  <div class="col-8">

    <div class="composer">
      <textarea id="research-input" placeholder="What happens if interest rates rise 1%?"></textarea>
      <div class="composer-bar">
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--fg-faint);">Runs a full scenario model over your data</span>
        <button class="send-btn" id="research-run" title="Run">↑</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="text-align:center; font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--fg-muted); margin:1.4rem 0 0.7rem;">Try research like…</p>
    <div class="suggest-grid">
      <button class="suggest" data-research-suggest>What if the ASX drops 20% next quarter? Analyse the impact</button>
      <button class="suggest" data-research-suggest>Run a Monte Carlo simulation for my retirement at 60</button>
      <button class="suggest" data-research-suggest>Stress test my portfolio against a property downturn</button>
      <button class="suggest" data-research-suggest>Compare salary sacrifice vs. extra mortgage repayments</button>
      <button class="suggest" data-research-suggest>What are my biggest financial risks right now?</button>
      <button class="suggest" data-research-suggest>Project my net worth if I save an extra $500/month</button>
    </div>

    <div class="banner banner-danger">
      <div class="banner-head">
        <span>⚠ Low data warning</span>
        <a href="/dashboard/assets" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Add Asset or Liability</a>
      </div>
      <strong style="font-size:0.85rem;">Not enough assets &amp; liabilities.</strong>
      <p>Research quality depends on your data. Add assets and liabilities or connect a bank via Basiq first.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="assistant-card">
      <div class="avatar">M</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem;">How to use Research</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--fg-muted); margin:0.4rem 0 0; line-height:1.6;">
          Ask "what happens if…?" questions and Mizan runs the numbers across your portfolio, super, debts and cash flow —
          due diligence and what-if modelling in one flow. Reports land here and in your email when complete.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="col-4">
    <div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
      <div class="panel-title">Research History</div>
      <div id="research-history"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title">Suggested Research</div>
      <div class="row-item"><div class="row-main">Market Scenarios</div></div>
      <div class="row-item"><div class="row-main">Simulations</div></div>
      <div class="row-item"><div class="row-main">Portfolio Analysis</div></div>
      <div class="row-item"><div class="row-main">Risk Assessment</div></div>
      <div class="row-item"><div class="row-main">Spending Insights</div></div>
      <div class="row-item"><div class="row-main">Buy a home</div></div>
      <div class="row-item"><div class="row-main">Super &amp; retirement</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
